flowchart LR
    classDef domain fill:#e8f0ff,stroke:#2f5bd1,color:#222;
    classDef db fill:#f5ebff,stroke:#7c49c9,color:#222;
    classDef fs fill:#e9f8ef,stroke:#2f8f46,color:#222;
    classDef note fill:#f7f7f7,stroke:#666,color:#222;

    QuoteFlow[Preventivo 3D]:::domain
    OrderFlow[Ordini e pagamenti]:::domain
    ContentFlow[Shop, media, QR e richieste custom]:::domain

    QuoteDb[(DB preventivo<br/>quote_sessions, quote_line_items)]:::db
    OrderDb[(DB ordini<br/>orders, order_items, payments, customers)]:::db
    ContentDb[(DB contenuti<br/>shop, media, qr, custom requests)]:::db

    QuoteFs[(storage_quotes<br/>modelli caricati e preview)]:::fs
    OrderFs[(storage_orders<br/>file finali e documenti)]:::fs
    ContentFs[(storage_shop + storage_media + storage_requests<br/>modelli shop, asset media, allegati)]:::fs

    QuoteFlow --> QuoteDb
    QuoteFlow --> QuoteFs

    OrderFlow --> OrderDb
    OrderFlow --> OrderFs

    ContentFlow --> ContentDb
    ContentFlow --> ContentFs

    Note1[Regola del progetto:<br/>il database salva metadata e stato;<br/>le cartelle storage_* salvano i file veri.]:::note
    Note1 -.-> QuoteDb
    Note1 -.-> QuoteFs
